      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems like this is most likely to occur for friends who go offline recently while your client is active, but will fix if you restart. Another telltale sign of this issue is when a friend recently goes offline during a session, instead of saying `Offline` underneath their name when looking in the Offline section of your friends list, it'll have their status instead.\n\nEither way, easiest to test this with someone who went offline within the last 60 minutes.\n\n1. A and B must be friends.\n\n2. Have either one go offline.\n\n3. Have the one still online immediately check offline friend's profile in-client and on website.\n\n4. Should see discrepancy between offline for between the two. (in-client being reported wrongly as offline longer than website / API.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
